    "summary": "<span>Heavy Rain Warning - 11-12 July</span>\n\n<span><span>lizt</span></span>\n\n<span><time datetime=\"2025-07-11T11:28:11+12:00\" title=\"Friday, July 11, 2025 - 11:28\">Fri, 11/07/2025 - 11:28</time>\n</span>\n\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-exclude-from-search field--type-search-api-exclude-entity field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Exclude from Search</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">Yes</div>\n          </div>\n\n            <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Heavy downpours and strong winds were felt overnight, and further showers are expected today.</p><p>Our district is saturated, so further slips, surface flooding, and rising rivers and streams are likely \u2013 especially near steep slopes and in low-lying areas. Please take care and drive to the conditions.</p><p><strong>Report any issues:</strong></p><ul><li>For urgent assistance, call us on 07 306 0500 (available 24/7)</li><li>Non urgent assistance - log it <a href=\"https://www.whakatane.govt.nz/fixit\">here</a>.</li></ul><p>Kia noho haumaru \u2013 stay safe and look out for each other.</p></div>\n      \n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-activate-site-wide-banner field--type-boolean field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Activate Site Wide Banner</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">Turn off site wide banner</div>\n          </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-site-wide-banner-heading field--type-string field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Site Wide Banner Heading</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">Heavy Rain Warning - 11-12 July</div>\n          </div>\n\n  <div class=\"text-content clearfix field field--name-field-site-wide-banner-content field--type-text-long field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Site Wide Banner Content</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><p><a href=\"https://www.bopcivildefence.govt.nz/\" rel=\"external\">Bay of Plenty Civil Defence</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WhakataneDistrictCouncil/\" rel=\"external\">Whakat\u0101ne District Council Facebook page</a><br /><a href=\"https://www.whakatane.govt.nz/civildefence/heavy-rain-warning-11-12-july\">More information \u00bb</a></p></div>\n          </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-site-wide-banner-colour field--type-list-string field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Site Wide Banner Colour</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\">Orange</div>\n          </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-event-status-updates field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Event Status Updates</div>\n          <div class=\"field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\">  <div class=\"paragraph paragraph--type--status-update paragraph--view-mode--default\">\n          \n      </div>\n</div>\n              </div>\n      </div>",
